# LiNC simulation post-GUI wiring.
#
# Loaded by linc-display after the linc GUI has created its linc.* component.
# The reference simulation already owns iocontrol.0.tool-changed through the
# `tool-changed` signal; the HMI pulses that signal only after a validated
# manual tool-change acknowledgement.

net linc-status linc.status-display => cnc_panel.sseg_status
net tool-changed linc.tool-change-confirm
net linc-hmi-heartbeat linc.hmi-alive
